@prefix autofde: <https://seanchatmangpt.github.io/autofde/ontology#> .
@prefix dcat: <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .


#################################################################
# Semantic Foundation Compiler
#################################################################

autofde:EnterpriseProblem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AdmittedObservation .
autofde:SemanticRequirement a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:MandatoryConcept a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:SemanticRequirement .
autofde:CompetencyQuestion a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:SemanticSource a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity , dcat:Resource .
autofde:SourceVersion a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:SourceKind a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .
autofde:LicenseEvidence a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:CoverageClaim a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:SourceClassification a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Classification .
autofde:SemanticPortfolio a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:PortfolioRevision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:SemanticPortfolio .
autofde:SelectionDecision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:AdmissionDecision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:RejectionDecision a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:SemanticProfile a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:CrosswalkMapping a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:ShapeSet a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:GeneratedSDK a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact .
autofde:CompetencyResult a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Evidence .
autofde:SemanticCompilerRun a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Construction .
autofde:SourceRegistry a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:Artifact , dcat:Catalog .
autofde:ProviderIdentity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf autofde:AutoFDEEntity .
autofde:SourceAuthority a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf skos:Concept .

#################################################################
